ame": "Rockman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Marethyu_9/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 115, "playtime_forever": 1977, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 741, "last_played": 1675822336, "avatar": "8893b521c7291d3958d89846d1cd05662c4cd337"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is amazing. I greatly enjoy Risk of Rain 2, but the first is excellent in its own right. Honestly it is much harder. Getting to a successful run feels challenging and really rewarding. Also, the music is fantastic!\n\nThe biggest issue in the game is that multiplayer is rather garbage. It is the old school type that requires port forwarding. It is possible to get working and runs quite well, but is a pain to start up non the less. \n\nThe game also apparently doesn't run well on linux.\n\nUpdate: With the release of Risk of Rain Returns, this game has become somewhat obsolete. Returns is a very good remaster with updated code, graphics, new content, and easy to use multiplayer. You can even modify the game rules to play exactly like the original. If you have to choose, pick RoR Returns. \n", "timestamp_created": 1568429848, "timestamp_updated": 1699806283, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55020393", "author": {"steamid": "76561198431381992", "personaname": "kkt.dude74", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198431381992/", "num_games_owned": 39, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 1045, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 460, "last_played": 1607981889, "avatar": "e65d31afceb389b5bb057fb69d5892f21cf67327"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty freakin hard but is a fun 2D